  {
    "directory": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14083350",
    "question": {
      "math_academy_id": "q-32817",
      "knowledge_point_id": "debd4ccc-de40-55a6-9236-9bf9fff0bdb1",
      "knowledge_point": "Finding the Parametric Equations of a Line",
      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14083350/assets/1ffc0945ea74b1bd467a0b9935ee28b88be004c18b11492d67ecdfec56e1bb09.png)\n\nFind the parametric equations of the line shown in the figure above.",
      "worked_solution": "We know that the line passes through the points $P(-1,3,2)$ and $Q(2,4,5).$ Now, we need to find a direction vector that is parallel to the given line. We can use the vector $\\overset{\\to }{PQ}$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v & =\\overset{\\to }{PQ} \\\\  & =\\overset{\\to }{OQ}-\\overset{\\to }{OP} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the vector equation of the line is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r & =p+tv \\\\ r & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]+t[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}3t \\\\ t \\\\ 3t\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}-1+3t \\\\ 3+t \\\\ 2+3t\\end{aligned}],\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).$ And finally, the parametric equations:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x=-1+3t \\\\ y=3+t \\\\ z=2+3t\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "answer_fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices_complete": true,
          "choices": [
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "{\\begin{aligned}x=-t \\\\ y=3t \\\\ z=2t\\end{aligned}",
              "option": "0",
              "source_option": "a"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "{\\begin{aligned}x=3t \\\\ y=t \\\\ z=3t\\end{aligned}",
              "option": "1",
              "source_option": "b"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "{\\begin{aligned}x=-1+3t \\\\ y=3+t \\\\ z=2+3t\\end{aligned}",
              "option": "2",
              "source_option": "c"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "{\\begin{aligned}x=2-t \\\\ y=4+3t \\\\ z=5+2t\\end{aligned}",
              "option": "3",
              "source_option": "d"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "{\\begin{aligned}x=3-t \\\\ y=1+3t \\\\ z=3+2t\\end{aligned}",
              "option": "4",
              "source_option": "e"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
